asset:        NotoSansSymbols2-Regular.ttf
title:        Noto Sans Symbols 2 Regular (chrome symbols such as ✔ and ▣)
author:       The Noto Project Authors
source:       https://github.com/notofonts/symbols (Google Fonts commit 47d54ca1ebb14fd864695f1d39dc734f39017c33, file ofl/notosanssymbols2/NotoSansSymbols2-Regular.ttf)
