added:        2026-10-24 by @skylartaylor
notes:        Unmodified font file, sha256 7d5fb73b7ca67a6798101741f5d280a3d016a56a197afcd4199dbb57b4b82a21. Embedded with include_bytes! in crates/ui-egui/src/theme.rs as the last UI fallback so every family can draw the chrome symbols (U+2714 ✔, U+25A3 ▣) that Inter, Inter Medium, Inter SemiBold and JetBrains Mono lack.
